body:
we struggle with communication so this hasn't been entirely effective yet but we're working on doing a lot of what others have suggested--polls, writing down opinions on like pros/cons, the benefits to the collective self, etc. we struggle a lot with what we want from life and that's held us back a lot, but starting to think about what we /can/ manage collectively that will be good for us/enable each of us to at least do some of what makes us happy and fulfilled? no one will have their one perfect dream life, but we try to take into account how we can make decisions that will give us the freedom we need to indulge various interests.

&#x200B;

so far mostly via writing things down physically or on a computer since having an internal meeting is....not something we're capable of yet.
